>chr1
_. 
-1GT112SFP is an unmanaged industrial Ethernet Switch. Its network configuration consists of 4*1000Base-T ports and 12*1000M SFP SFP slots, which optimize industrial project with high reliability, flexibility and safety. It is available for reliable and stable data transmission.STP/RSTP/MSTP/ERPS supporting redundant network to ensure reliable operation in harsh environment.

Features

* DIN-Rail/Wall-mountable
* Anodized metal housing
* IP40 rated protection, supports -40℃ to 85℃ operating temperature range
* CE, FCC, RoHS, ISO9001 certificates passed
* Testing in a wide range of temperatures and meet EN50121-4 railway EMC standards
